Corrected obligation
==============================================================================
The universal Bonferroni-3 target is false.
  counterexample: r0=3 and order-3 gap=-11321/6144600<0, while order-4 gap=1/931>0.

Sharp target:
  if r0<=2, prove T_>=4<=0 and close with order 3;
  if r0=3, prove T_>=5<=0 and close with order 4;
  if r0>=4, prove a slack bound p0<<cap or route to finite residual atlases.

This keeps the Legendre/Venn layer labels but adds the missing
activation-depth address before scalarizing the far-packet expansion.

